{"overview":"یک مکانیک جوان مسابقه‌ای برای حفظ شهرتش به صورت رسمی با پرستاره‌ترین ستارهٔ دنیای مسابقه ازدواج جعلی می‌کند؛ اما به‌طور مخفیانه برای این ستاره فرصتی برای سوار شدن پشت فرمان می‌خواهد. به زودی این دروغ تهدید می‌کند که همه چیز را نابود کند—از جملهٔ آنچه دیگر فقط یک معامله نیست، بلکه چیزی بسیار بزرگ‌تر شده است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A young race car mechanic fakes an engagement with racing's most scandalous star - officially for his reputation, secretly for her own shot behind the wheel. But soon the lie threatens to destroy everything - including what's already become so much more than just a deal.","tagline_en":"","runtime":103,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Sergej Moya"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["DE"],"cast":[{"name":"Lisa-Marie Koroll","role":"Sarah Jenkins","photo":"/5wgbyqv6MK3hQyeKdQrIf3k3nZW.jpg"},{"name":"Amin Baahmed","role":"Dante Annunziata","photo":"/oyFyPJkzefovbnRE6DnWwwYLZaD.jpg"},{"name":"Gustav Schmidt","role":"Ruben Laroch","photo":"/okAsgPvMjDEVkLg5S2lyfZbsGvD.jpg"},{"name":"Mišel Matičević","role":"Alexander Bronson","photo":"/jKYzgKIBs4O7eBBMDKk1T5RWYjN.jpg"},{"name":"Lucie Heinze","role":"Tanya Stein","photo":"/mOOEz6Xx06RGPn6Wqo2Thy4H2XI.jpg"},{"name":"Frederic Linkemann","role":"Jack Schroder","photo":"/wjjTwrOFcW3KZua8ah2j8qBqVFe.jpg"},{"name":"Inka Friedrich","role":"Irene Jenkins","photo":"/a90LTNdgFE5NHPGTNurWO2IXKhc.jpg"},{"name":"ژانت هاین","role":"Sofia Annunziata","photo":"/6FkzcacM6wCKovrE7OIvN74KPMZ.jpg","en":"Jeanette Hain"},{"name":"Philippe Brenninkmeyer","role":"Dr. Frederic Richter","photo":"/cfYuU75rDWr5xnpodR7FLbzvv4o.jpg"},{"name":"Leslie Malton","role":"Eva Maria Fischer","photo":"/sC8tgPm1jF73u2eeK2ZiZ9uI3MA.jpg"},{"name":"Sára Korbelová","role":"Gabriella Annunziata","photo":"/5dRPCDcvQ1gr6pY40jcp0U2TZWL.jpg"},{"name":"Steven Gätjen","role":"Red Carpet Host","photo":"/4mCkEUgCeHtfsVnbwyjwPePTWAt.jpg"}],"trailer":"-sV69CJwUwU","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/mo